{
 "action": "take_coach",
 "words": "I'm heading out. The couch doesn't move itself, and I need to be there when that van pulls up.",
 "intention": "To physically arrive in Pittsburgh before Wednesday to guarantee the couch move happens, breaking the cycle by ensuring my presence is the constant variable.","detail": "I stand up, grab my coat, and walk toward the door. I don't stop for coffee. I don't talk to Larry. I don't look at the piano. I go to the station. I board the coach. I sit down. I wait for the wheels to turn. The van driver in Pittsburgh needs to see me at 8 AM. If I am not there, the day resets. If I am there, maybe it moves."
}
